# Выполняйте после регистрации, подтверждения email и входа (см. Wubble.Api.http).
# Вставьте JWT из wubble_access и ID из ответов создания.
@host = https://localhost:7051
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@monitorId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@checkId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Создать Monitor
POST {{host}}/api/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "My Shop",
  "description": "HTTP-мониторинг проекта",
  "emailNotificationsEnabled": false
}

### Список Monitor
GET {{host}}/api/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Создать Check на паузе для первого ручного запуска
POST {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Главная страница",
  "url": "https://example.com/",
  "method": "GET",
  "intervalSeconds": 300,
  "timeoutSeconds": 10,
  "expectedStatusCode": 200,
  "bodyContains": "Example Domain",
  "failureThreshold": 3,
  "recoveryThreshold": 1,
  "isEnabled": false
}

### Ручной запуск
POST {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}/run
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Включить расписание
PATCH {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isEnabled": true }

### Текущий статус и расписание
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### История
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}/results?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Статистика за последние 7 дней
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Активные инциденты Monitor
GET {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/incidents?isOpen=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Пауза
PATCH {{host}}/api/monitors/{{monitorId}}/checks/{{checkId}}/state
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isEnabled": false }
